    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        2470,
        2070,
        2796
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Pursuant to Section 2575, subdivision 8 of the Education Law, as added by Laws 1966, Ch. 611, the annexed resolution of the Board of Education, adopted on June 15, 1966, amending the provisions governing the Board of Education Retirement System to the ex-sequent necessary to put into effect a pensions-providing-for-increased-take-home-pay plan for the fiscal year 1966-1967 analogous to that authorized by Laws 1962, Ch. 787, is hereby approved.",
